essed what  was about to be revealed never  whoa wow this actually this case is  haunting I think that when people see  the report it will stay with them for a  long time because it has really bothered  us why was this screenshot from Snapchat  so crucial well because investigators  have very little to go on I mean this  was a couple they seemingly had no  marital problems they had no financial  problems and then they vanished their  car was in the garage when you called  them it just went to voicemail  um they they worked they didn't take any  money out of the bank I mean they  literally vanished so if investigators  couldn't track their whereabouts they  would track the one person who had seen  them last which was their youngest son  why was the girlfriend tracking Chandler  did she not well she didn't trust him  because he was pretty popular with women  and he had gone out with other women and  you know with Snapchat you realize that  you could message someone and track  their location at the same time so the  only way she would continue dating him  was if he allowed that and and it just  when the police asked her she had no  idea what was on her phone and when the  police asked her to if they could  download it that's where they found it  and it really did Crack the Case in a  very very sad upsetting way Aaron cannot  wait to watch this thank you and don't  forget you can watch Aaron's report the  Snapchat clue on 48 hours tomorrow night  at 10 9 Central right here on CBS and  Paramount Plus
 

